* History of malignancy other than hepatocellular carcinoma, unless meeting the following criteria: a) The patient received potentially curative treatment and there has been no evidence of disease for 5 years; b) Successfully treated resected cutaneous basal cell carcinoma, cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma, superficial bladder cancer, cervical carcinoma in situ, or other carcinoma in situ;

